        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B581, Single Sided Deadbolt With Exposed Outside Trim Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage's One-Sided Commercial Deadbolt with universal adjustable backset and 1 inch throw bolt uses thumbturn inside with an exterior plate to cover exposed door prep on the outside. An ANSI certified grade 2 deadbolt, the B581 includes a reinforced strike plate. It is used for locking and unlocking the door from the inside only; the inside thumbturn operates the deadbolt and it has a blank plate on the outside. It is easy to install on almost any door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/residential-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b81\"><b>Schlage B81 Residential Single Sided Deadbolt With Exposed Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b>Schlage B60 Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b62\"><b>Schlage B62 Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/one-sided-deadbolt-schlage-b80\"><b>Schlage B80 One-Sided Deadbolt With No Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage B581 Turnbolt Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim.</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Available in 7 finishes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B581 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. Exterior plate covers exposed door preparation on the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
